<!-- views/landing.ejs — public marketing landing page at / -->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>ReceipTap — Tap-to-receive digital receipts for your store</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Replace paper receipts with a tap. Customers get their receipt on their phone; you get their email, a Google review funnel, and repeat-customer analytics. Works with Square & Shopify." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/receiptap.css" />
  <style>
    .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 6vw; }
    .nav img { height: 40px; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink-soft); }
    .nav-cta { background: var(--teal); color: #fff !important; padding: 9px 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; }

    .hero { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6vw; padding: 6vh 6vw 10vh; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero-copy { flex: 1.15; }
    .hero-visual { flex: 1; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4.4vw, 52px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .hero h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--teal); }
    .hero-sub { font-size: 16.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.55; max-width: 460px; margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .cta-main {
      display: inline-block; background: var(--teal); color: #fff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;
      padding: 15px 28px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none;
    }
    .cta-main:hover { background: var(--teal-deep); }
    .cta-fine { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 10px; }
    .pos-badges { margin-top: 26px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
    .pos-badges strong { color: var(--ink); }

    /* Signature: receipt printing out of the puck */
    .puck-scene { width: 300px; }
    .puck {
      width: 130px; height: 46px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 60px;
      background: var(--ink); position: relative; z-index: 2;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(28,27,25,0.22);
    }
    .puck::after {
      content: '⌁'; color: var(--teal); font-size: 20px; position: absolute;
      left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -52%);
    }
    .tap-ring {
      position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 20px; height: 20px;
      border: 2px solid var(--teal); border-radius: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%); opacity: 0;
      animation: ring 3.6s ease-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes ring {
      0%, 55% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.4); }
      62% { opacity: 0.85; }
      82%, 100% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(3.4); }
    }
    .receipt-slot { height: 296px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: -8px; }
    .receipt-strip {
      width: 220px; background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px; padding: 16px 18px 14px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--ink);
      animation: printout 3.6s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) infinite;
      transform-origin: top center;
    }
    @keyframes printout {
      0% { transform: translateY(-105%); }
      45%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .receipt-strip .rrow { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    .receipt-strip .rtotal { font-weight: 700; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 8px; }
    .receipt-strip .rsaved {
      margin-top: 12px; text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700; color: var(--teal-deep); background: var(--teal-wash);
      border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 0;
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .receipt-strip { animation: none; }
      .tap-ring { animation: none; opacity: 0; }
    }

    .section { padding: 64px 6vw; max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .section-eyebrow { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--teal-deep); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.07em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .section h2 { font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px); letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .section-lead { font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 560px; }

    .problem-band { background: var(--paper-raised); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .problem-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 28px; margin-top: 34px; }
    .problem-grid .p-num { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal); }
    .problem-grid h3 { font-size: 16px; margin: 8px 0 6px; }
    .problem-grid p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; }

    .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 22px; margin-top: 36px; }
    .step {
      background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px;
    }
    .step .s-num {
      width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .step h3 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .step p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; }

    .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; margin-top: 36px; }
    .split-card { background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; }
    .split-card h3 { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .split-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .split-card li { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 9px 0 9px 26px; position: relative; }
    .split-card li::before { content: '✓'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--teal); font-weight: 700; }
    .split-card li strong { font-weight: 600; }
    .split-card li span { color: var(--ink-soft); }

    .pricing-card {
      max-width: 430px; margin: 36px auto 0; background: var(--paper-raised);
      border: 2px solid var(--teal); border-radius: 20px; padding: 34px 32px; text-align: center;
    }
    .price { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 44px; font-weight: 600; }
    .price small { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-family: var(--font-body); }
    .pricing-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0 24px; text-align: left; }
    .pricing-card li { font-size: 13.5px; padding: 7px 0 7px 24px; position: relative; }
    .pricing-card li::before { content: '✓'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--teal); font-weight: 700; }

    .faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 0; }
    .faq-item summary { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; padding: 14px 0; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
    .faq-item summary::after { content: '+'; float: right; color: var(--teal); font-weight: 700; }
    .faq-item[open] summary::after { content: '–'; }
    .faq-item p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; }

    .final-band { background: var(--ink); text-align: center; padding: 72px 6vw; }
    .final-band h2 { color: var(--paper); font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .final-band p { color: #B7B4AC; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 26px; }

    footer { padding: 28px 6vw; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .hero { flex-direction: column; padding-top: 3vh; }
      .problem-grid, .steps, .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-visual { order: -1; }
      .puck-scene { transform: scale(0.9); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav class="nav">
    <a href="/"><img src="/images/receiptap-logo.png" alt="ReceipTap" /></a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/account/login">Customer wallet</a>
      <a href="/login">Log in</a>
      <a href="/signup" class="nav-cta">Start free trial</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1>The receipt goes to their phone.<br /><em>The relationship</em> goes to you.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        ReceipTap replaces paper receipts with a tap. Your customers get every receipt on
        their phone — and you get their email, a Google review funnel, and repeat-customer
        analytics from sales you were already making.
      </p>
      <a class="cta-main" href="/signup">Start your 30-day free trial</a>
      <div class="cta-fine">$49.99 USD/month after trial · cancel anytime before it ends and pay nothing</div>
      <div class="pos-badges">Works with <strong>Square</strong> and <strong>Shopify POS</strong> — no new register, no new workflow.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="puck-scene">
        <div class="puck"><span class="tap-ring"></span></div>
        <div class="receipt-slot">
          <div class="receipt-strip">
            <div style="text-align:center; font-weight:700;">TIP TOP TINT</div>
            <div class="rrow"><span>Ceramic tint — 2 dr</span><span>380.00</span></div>
            <div class="rrow"><span>Windshield strip</span><span>60.00</span></div>
            <div class="rrow"><span>HST 13%</span><span>57.20</span></div>
            <div class="rrow rtotal"><span>TOTAL</span><span>497.20</span></div>
            <div class="rsaved">✓ Saved to phone</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section problem-band" style="max-width: none;">
    <div style="max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">The problem with paper</div>
      <h2>Every paper receipt is a dead end.</h2>
      <div class="problem-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="p-num">90%</div>
          <h3>Thrown away or lost</h3>
          <p>Most paper receipts are in the trash — or a pocket — within a day. When your customer needs it for a return or warranty, it's gone.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="p-num">$0</div>
          <h3>Nothing comes back to you</h3>
          <p>A paper receipt tells you nothing about who bought, whether they've been in before, or how to reach them again. The sale ends at the register.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="p-num">∞</div>
          <h3>Endless thermal paper</h3>
          <p>Rolls, jams, replacements, and BPA-coated paper nobody wants to touch. A cost with no upside, forever.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">How it works</div>
    <h2>Live in an afternoon. No new hardware at the register.</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="s-num">1</div>
        <h3>Connect your POS</h3>
        <p>Link your Square or Shopify account in a couple of clicks. Sales start flowing into ReceipTap automatically — nothing changes about how you ring people up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="s-num">2</div>
        <h3>Put the puck on your counter</h3>
        <p>The ReceipTap puck sits next to your register. No wiring into your till, no software to install on it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="s-num">3</div>
        <h3>Customers tap. That's it.</h3>
        <p>After paying, they tap their phone on the puck and their receipt appears — no app to download, no account required to receive it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Two-sided value</div>
    <h2>Good for your business. Genuinely useful for your customers.</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Most receipt tools serve one side. ReceipTap only works because both sides want it.</p>
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split-card">
        <h3>For your business</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Customer emails, captured at checkout</strong> — <span>build a real list from people who already bought.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Google review funnel</strong> — <span>the receipt screen asks happy customers to leave a review, right at the moment of purchase.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Repeat-customer analytics</strong> — <span>see who comes back, how often, and what your regulars actually spend.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Branded receipts</strong> — <span>your logo, your colors, your review link — not a generic printout.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="split-card">
        <h3>For their customers</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Every receipt in one wallet</strong> — <span>searchable by store and date when they need a return or warranty claim.</span></li>
          <li><strong>AI-organized spending</strong> — <span>receipts are categorized automatically, with possible tax deductions flagged.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Nothing to install</strong> — <span>tap, receive, done. A wallet account is optional, not required.</span></li>
          <li><strong>PDF anytime</strong> — <span>a proper receipt document on demand, for expense reports and bookkeeping.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="pricing">
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Pricing</div>
      <h2>One plan. Everything included.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-card">
      <div class="price">$49.99<small> USD / month</small></div>
      <div style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 4px;">per location · 30-day free trial</div>
      <ul>
        <li>Unlimited digital receipts</li>
        <li>Square & Shopify POS integration</li>
        <li>Email capture + Google review funnel</li>
        <li>Repeat-customer & revenue analytics</li>
        <li>AI receipt categorization for your customers</li>
        <li>Cancel anytime — trial ends, no charge</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="cta-main" href="/signup" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;">Start 30-day free trial</a>
      <div class="cta-fine">Card required to start · charged only when the trial ends</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="max-width: 720px;">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Questions</div>
    <h2>What store owners ask us</h2>
    <div style="margin-top: 22px;">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Do my customers need to download an app?</summary>
        <p>No. They tap the puck and the receipt opens on their phone instantly. Creating a wallet account (to keep all their receipts in one place) is optional.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Which POS systems does it work with?</summary>
        <p>Square and Shopify POS today, with more integrations on the roadmap. If you use something else, tell us — it directly shapes what we build next.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Does it change how I ring up sales?</summary>
        <p>No. ReceipTap listens to sales your POS already records. Your checkout flow, your staff's routine, and your register stay exactly as they are.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What if I cancel during the trial?</summary>
        <p>You pay nothing. The card you add at signup is only charged when the 30-day trial ends, and you can cancel anytime before then from your dashboard.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Can I still print paper receipts for people who want them?</summary>
        <p>Yes. ReceipTap runs alongside your printer, not instead of it — customers who want paper still get paper.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final-band">
    <h2>Your next sale can be the start of a relationship.</h2>
    <p>Set up in an afternoon. Free for 30 days. Cancel anytime.</p>
    <a class="cta-main" href="/signup">Start your free trial</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <span>© 2026 ReceipTap</span>
    <span><a href="/login" style="color: inherit;">Merchant log in</a> · <a href="/account/login" style="color: inherit;">Customer wallet</a></span>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
